# 31. Research Standard

The objective of this project is not to prove that TMF is predictable.

The objective is to determine whether measurable predictive information exists.

A hypothesis that fails is still a useful research result.

Variables will not be selected solely because they produced favorable historical results, and models will not be considered successful unless their relationships demonstrate reasonable stability on previously unseen data.

